    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>You come from a proud warrior culture, and your pride fills you with self-assurance.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Gungan\" title=\"Gungan\">Gungan</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> You gain a +2 morale bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a> when you wield an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Atlatl\" title=\"Atlatl\">Atlatl</a> or a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Cesta\" title=\"Cesta\">Cesta</a>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
